Attribute edge cases

```
[note]{.a .b #n key=val}
.
<p><span class="a b" id="n" key="val">note</span></p>
```

```
[x]{title="a b"}
.
<p><span title="a b">x</span></p>
```

```
[x]{data-x="{y}"}
.
<p><span data-x="{y}">x</span></p>
```

```
[t](u){k="{y}"}
.
<p><a href="u" k="{y}">t</a></p>
```

```
![a](u){k="{y}"}
.
<img src="u" alt="a" k="{y}">
```

```
# H {k="{y}"}
.
<section id="h">
  <h1 k="{y}">H</h1>
</section>
```

```
{k="{y}"}
:::
body
:::
.
<div k="{y}">
  <p>body</p>
</div>
```

```
:kbd[x]{k="{y}"}
.
<p><kbd k="{y}">x</kbd></p>
```

```
[x]{k='{y}'}
.
<p><span k="{y}">x</span></p>
```

```
:kbd[x]{.foo}
.
<p><kbd class="foo">x</kbd></p>
```

```
[x]{title="a\"b"}
.
<p><span title="a&quot;b">x</span></p>
```

```
# H {title="a\"b"}
.
<section id="h">
  <h1 title="a&quot;b">H</h1>
</section>
```

```
# H {???}
.
<section id="h">
  <h1>H {???}</h1>
</section>
```
